Z||000006||theogre||10-21-2001||02:10 PM||||One of the best discriptions I know of online about how a brake booster works is at <A HREF="http://www.howstuffworks.com" TARGET=_blank>www.howstuffworks.com</A>  It's even animated to show better exactly what happens whe you push the peddal. The only thing they didn't cover in that brake series was how step bore master cylinders work.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
